# Supply-chain cooldown: `npm install` / `npm update` / `npm audit fix` refuse versions published < 7 days ago
# (most hijacked releases are caught and unpublished within days). `npm ci` is unaffected: locked versions always
# install. Same-day fix needed? add the package to `min-release-age-exclude`. Needs npm >= 11 (Node 24); older npm
# ignores the key.
min-release-age=7
